 "comment": "The bounded pull page both sides must decode alike: `mode: \"bootstrap\"`, the echoed channel and origin, the interval the page covers (`from` exclusive, `to` inclusive), and the channel head the page transaction observed. Records are the same receipt-shaped authority a pull page carries, at most 50 of them, once each. `to == until` is completion; no done flag travels. `from <= to <= until <= head` always holds.",
